#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Serve the authenticated HTTP API for persona sessions, threads and installation
settings. In split mode the provider host owns live processes and journals; replacing
the API reconnects to that host. The combined broker implements the same interface
locally.

Numbered provider and broker events can be replayed from their sequence. A
broker.session snapshot carries record_seq, the last journal position, so
reconnecting clients cannot mistake the snapshot for a delivered event. Store user
input durably because a provider may never echo it.

See broker/README.md for routes, event shapes, permissions, provider sign-in and
recovery.
"""

